<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Rádio Jovem FM – A Rádio que Toca o Seu Coração</title>
<meta name="description" content="Ouça Rádio Jovem FM ao vivo. A melhor música sertaneja, pop e romântica 24 horas por dia.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Rajdhani:wght@500;600;700&family=Barlow:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css">
<style>
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
  :root{
    --gold:#F5A623;--orange:#E8650A;--pink:#E91E8C;--blue:#00C2FF;
    --dark:#08080F;--dark2:#0F0F1A;--dark3:#161625;--dark4:#1E1E32;
    --border:rgba(245,166,35,0.18);--text:#F0EEE8;--muted:#7A7890;
  }
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
  body{font-family:'Barlow',sans-serif;background:var(--dark);color:var(--text);overflow-x:hidden}

  /* PARTICLES BG */
  #particles{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;overflow:hidden}
  .particle{position:absolute;border-radius:50%;animation:float linear infinite;opacity:0}
  @keyframes float{0%{transform:translateY(100vh) scale(0);opacity:0}10%{opacity:1}90%{opacity:0.5}100%{transform:translateY(-10vh) scale(1);opacity:0}}

  /* NAV */
  nav{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;background:rgba(8,8,15,0.85);backdrop-filter:blur(20px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:0 5%}
  .nav-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:64px}
  .nav-logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;text-decoration:none}
  .nav-logo img{height:42px;width:42px;object-fit:contain;border-radius:8px}
  .nav-logo-text{font-family:'Rajdhani',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:20px;letter-spacing:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--gold),var(--pink));-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent}
  .nav-links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px}
  .nav-links a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;transition:color .2s;letter-spacing:0.5px}
  .nav-links a:hover{color:var(--gold)}
  .nav-links .btn-pedir{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--orange),var(--gold));color:#000;font-weight:700;padding:8px 22px;border-radius:25px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.5px}
  .nav-links .btn-pedir:hover{opacity:0.85;color:#000}
  .hamburger{display:none;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;cursor:pointer;padding:4px}
  .hamburger span{width:24px;height:2px;background:var(--gold);border-radius:2px;transition:all .3s}
  .mobile-menu{display:none;position:fixed;top:64px;left:0;right:0;background:var(--dark2);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:20px;z-index:99;flex-direction:column;gap:16px}
  .mobile-menu a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-size:16px;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
  .mobile-menu.open{display:flex}

  /* HERO */
  .hero{position:relative;min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;z-index:1;padding:100px 5% 60px}
  .hero-glow{position:absolute;top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:600px;height:600px;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(232,101,10,0.12) 0%,rgba(233,30,140,0.06) 50%,transparent 70%);pointer-events:none}
  .hero-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:rgba(233,30,140,0.12);border:1px solid rgba(233,30,140,0.35);color:var(--pink);font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:6px 16px;border-radius:20px;letter-spacing:1.5px;margin-bottom:28px;text-transform:uppercase}
  .live-pulse{width:8px;height:8px;background:var(--pink);border-radius:50%;animation:livepulse 1.4s infinite}
  @keyframes livepulse{0%,100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(233,30,140,0.6)}50%{box-shadow:0 0 0 8px rgba(233,30,140,0)}}
  .hero h1{font-family:'Rajdhani',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(48px,8vw,96px);font-weight:700;line-height:0.9;letter-spacing:-1px;margin-bottom:8px}
  .hero h1 span{display:block;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold) 0%,var(--orange) 50%,var(--pink) 100%);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent}
  .hero-sub{font-size:clamp(14px,2vw,18px);color:var(--muted);font-weight:300;margin-bottom:40px;letter-spacing:0.5px}

  /* PLAYER */
  .player-card{background:rgba(22,22,37,0.9);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;padding:28px 32px;max-width:560px;width:100%;margin:0 auto;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
  .player-card::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:2px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--orange),var(--gold),var(--pink))}
  .now-playing-label{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:14px}
  .song-info{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;margin-bottom:20px}
  .vinyl-disc{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--dark4),var(--dark3));border:3px solid var(--gold);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0}
  .vinyl-disc i{font-size:20px;color:var(--gold)}
  .vinyl-disc.spinning{animation:spin 5s linear infinite}
  @keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
  .song-title{font-family:'Rajdhani',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text)}
  .song-artist{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}
  .player-controls{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:18px}
  .vol-wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex:1}
  .vol-wrap i{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
  .vol-slider{flex:1;-webkit-appearance:none;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--dark4);outline:none;cursor:pointer}
  .vol-slider::-webkit-slider-thumb{-webkit-appearance:none;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold);cursor:pointer}
  .btn-play{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--orange),var(--gold));border:none;color:#000;font-size:22px;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:all .2s;flex-shrink:0}
  .btn-play:hover{transform:scale(1.08)}
  .visualizer{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:3px;height:32px}
  .v-bar{width:4px;border-radius:2px 2px 0 0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--pink),var(--gold));animation:vbar linear infinite}
  @keyframes vbar{0%,100%{height:4px}50%{height:var(--h)}}
  .player-meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:16px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
  .listeners-count{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
  .listeners-count i{color:var(--pink)}
  .share-btns{display:flex;gap:8px}
  .share-btn{background:rgba(245,166,35,0.1);border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--gold);width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:6px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;text-decoration:none}
  .share-btn:hover{background:rgba(245,166,35,0.2)}

  /* SECTIONS */
  section{position:relative;z-index:1;padding:80px 5%}
  .section-title{font-family:'Rajdhani',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,42px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8px}
  .section-title span{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--gold),var(--pink));-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent}
  .section-sub{text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;margin-bottom:48px}

  /* PROGRAMAÇÃO */
  .prog-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:16px}
  .prog-card{background:var(--dark3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;padding:20px;transition:all .3s;cursor:default}
  .prog-card:hover{border-color:rgba(245,166,35,0.45);transform:translateY(-3px)}
  .prog-card.live{border-color:rgba(233,30,140,0.4);background:rgba(22,22,37,0.9)}
  .prog-time{font-family:'Rajdhani',sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:var(--gold);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:6px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
  .prog-live-tag{background:var(--pink);color:#fff;font-size:9px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;animation:fadeblink 1.5s infinite}
  @keyframes fadeblink{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:0.5}}
  .prog-name{font-family:'Rajdhani',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:4px}
  .prog-host{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
  .prog-genre{display:inline-block;margin-top:10px;background:rgba(245,166,35,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(245,166,35,0.25);color:var(--gold);font-size:11px;padding:3px 12px;border-radius:10px}

  /* PEDIDO */
  .pedido-wrap{max-width:580px;margin:0 auto}
  .pedido-form{background:var(--dark3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:32px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
  .pedido-form::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:2px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--pink),var(--orange))}
  .form-group{margin-bottom:16px}
  .form-label{display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px;letter-spacing:0.5px;text-transform:uppercase}
  .form-input{width:100%;background:var(--dark4);border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;font-family:'Barlow',sans-serif;font-size:14px;outline:none;transition:border-color .2s}
  .form-input:focus{border-color:var(--gold)}
  .form-input::placeholder{color:var(--muted)}
  .form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
  .btn-enviar{width:100%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--pink),var(--orange));border:none;color:#fff;font-family:'Rajdhani',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer;letter-spacing:1px;transition:all .2s;margin-top:4px}
  .btn-enviar:hover{opacity:0.88;transform:translateY(-1px)}
  .toast{position:fixed;bottom:30px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(80px);background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--orange),var(--gold));color:#000;font-weight:700;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:12px;font-size:14px;z-index:999;transition:transform .4s;white-space:nowrap;pointer-events:none}
  .toast.show{transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0)}

  /* FOOTER */
  footer{background:var(--dark2);border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding:40px 5% 24px;position:relative;z-index:1}
  .footer-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr 1fr;gap:40px;margin-bottom:32px}
  .footer-brand .nav-logo-text{font-size:22px}
  .footer-desc{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;margin-top:10px}
  .footer-social{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:14px}
  .social-btn{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;text-decoration:none;transition:all .2s}
  .social-btn:hover{border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--gold)}
  .footer-col h4{font-family:'Rajdhani',sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:14px;text-transform:uppercase}
  .footer-col a{display:block;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:8px;transition:color .2s}
  .footer-col a:hover{color:var(--text)}
  .footer-bottom{border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
  .footer-bottom a{color:var(--gold);text-decoration:none}

  @media(max-width:768px){
    .nav-links{display:none}
    .hamburger{display:flex}
    .footer-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .prog-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="particles"></div>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav>
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <a class="nav-logo" href="index.html">
      <img src="assets/logo.png" alt="Rádio Jovem FM">
      <span class="nav-logo-text">JOVEM FM</span>
    </a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#programacao">Programação</a>
      <a href="#pedido">Pedir Música</a>
      <a href="#sobre">Sobre</a>
      <a href="admin/index.html">Admin</a>
      <a href="#pedido" class="btn-pedir"><i class="fas fa-music"></i> Pedir Agora</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hamburger" onclick="toggleMenu()">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>
<div class="mobile-menu" id="mobileMenu">
  <a href="#programacao" onclick="toggleMenu()">Programação</a>
  <a href="#pedido" onclick="toggleMenu()">Pedir Música</a>
  <a href="#sobre" onclick="toggleMenu()">Sobre</a>
  <a href="admin/index.html">Admin</a>
</div>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-glow"></div>
  <div>
    <div class="hero-badge"><span class="live-pulse"></span> Ao Vivo Agora</div>
    <h1><span>RÁDIO</span><span>JOVEM FM</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">A rádio que toca o seu coração — 24 horas de música</p>

    <div class="player-card">
      <div class="now-playing-label">&#9654; Tocando Agora</div>
      <div class="song-info">
        <div class="vinyl-disc spinning" id="vinylDisc">
          <i class="fas fa-music"></i>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="song-title" id="songTitle">Carregando...</div>
          <div class="song-artist" id="songArtist">Rádio Jovem FM</div>
        </div>
        <div class="visualizer" id="viz"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="player-controls">
        <div class="vol-wrap">
          <i class="fas fa-volume-down"></i>
          <input type="range" class="vol-slider" id="volSlider" min="0" max="100" value="80" oninput="setVolume(this.value)">
          <i class="fas fa-volume-up"></i>
        </div>
        <button class="btn-play" id="btnPlay" onclick="togglePlay()" aria-label="Play/Pause">
          <i class="fas fa-play" id="playIcon"></i>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="player-meta">
        <div class="listeners-count"><i class="fas fa-headphones"></i> <span id="listenerCount">1.284</span> ouvindo agora</div>
        <div class="share-btns">
          <a class="share-btn" href="https://wa.me/?text=Ouça%20Rádio%20Jovem%20FM%20ao%20vivo!" target="_blank" title="WhatsApp"><i class="fab fa-whatsapp"></i></a>
          <a class="share-btn" href="https://www.instagram.com/" target="_blank" title="Instagram"><i class="fab fa-instagram"></i></a>
          <a class="share-btn" href="https://www.facebook.com/" target="_blank" title="Facebook"><i class="fab fa-facebook-f"></i></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PROGRAMAÇÃO -->
<section id="programacao">
  <div class="section-title">Nossa <span>Programação</span></div>
  <p class="section-sub">Grade completa de segunda a domingo</p>
  <div class="prog-grid">
    <div class="prog-card">
      <div class="prog-time"><i class="fas fa-sun"></i> 06h00 – 09h00</div>
      <div class="prog-name">Bom Dia Total</div>
      <div class="prog-host"><i class="fas fa-microphone-alt"></i> Rodrigo Silva</div>
      <span class="prog-genre">Pop · Sertanejo</span>
    </div>
    <div class="prog-card">
      <div class="prog-time"><i class="fas fa-coffee"></i> 09h00 – 12h00</div>
      <div class="prog-name">Rádio Total</div>
      <div class="prog-host"><i class="fas fa-microphone-alt"></i> Ana Paula</div>
      <span class="prog-genre">Hits do Momento</span>
    </div>
    <div class="prog-card">
      <div class="prog-time"><i class="fas fa-newspaper"></i> 12h00 – 14h00</div>
      <div class="prog-name">Jornal Jovem</div>
      <div class="prog-host"><i class="fas fa-microphone-alt"></i> Bruno Castro</div>
      <span class="prog-genre">Notícias · Informação</span>
    </div>
    <div class="prog-card live">
      <div class="prog-time"><i class="fas fa-guitar"></i> 14h00 – 16h00 <span class="prog-live-tag">AO VIVO</span></div>
      <div class="prog-name">Sertanejo Total</div>
      <div class="prog-host"><i class="fas fa-microphone-alt"></i> Marcos Vieira</div>
      <span class="prog-genre">Sertanejo Universitário</span>
    </div>
    <div class="prog-card">
      <div class="prog-time"><i class="fas fa-fire"></i> 16h00 – 18h00</div>
      <div class="prog-name">Flash Hit</div>
      <div class="prog-host"><i class="fas fa-microphone-alt"></i> Ana Paula</div>
      <span class="prog-genre">Pop · Funk · Eletrônico</span>
    </div>
    <div class="prog-card">
      <div class="prog-time"><i class="fas fa-car"></i> 18h00 – 20h00</div>
      <div class="prog-name">Drive Total</div>
      <div class="prog-host"><i class="fas fa-microphone-alt"></i> Ricardo Fonseca</div>
      <span class="prog-genre">Variado</span>
    </div>
    <div class="prog-card">
      <div class="prog-time"><i class="fas fa-heart"></i> 20h00 – 22h00</div>
      <div class="prog-name">Noite Romântica</div>
      <div class="prog-host"><i class="fas fa-music"></i> Playlist Especial</div>
      <span class="prog-genre">Romântico</span>
    </div>
    <div class="prog-card">
      <div class="prog-time"><i class="fas fa-moon"></i> 22h00 – 06h00</div>
      <div class="prog-name">Madrugada Total</div>
      <div class="prog-host"><i class="fas fa-robot"></i> Automático</div>
      <span class="prog-genre">Todos os ritmos</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PEDIDO DE MÚSICA -->
<section id="pedido" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent,rgba(233,30,140,0.04),transparent)">
  <div class="section-title">Peça sua <span>Música</span></div>
  <p class="section-sub">Mande seu pedido e a dedicatória para quem você ama</p>
  <div class="pedido-wrap">
    <div class="pedido-form">
      <div class="form-row">
        <div class="form-group">
          <label class="form-label">Seu Nome</label>
          <input class="form-input" id="fNome" type="text" placeholder="Ex: Maria Silva">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label class="form-label">WhatsApp</label>
          <input class="form-input" id="fWhats" type="tel" placeholder="(45) 99999-9999">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label class="form-label">Música Desejada</label>
        <input class="form-input" id="fMusica" type="text" placeholder="Ex: Evidências – Chitãozinho & Xororó">
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label class="form-label">Dedicatória (opcional)</label>
        <input class="form-input" id="fDedica" type="text" placeholder="Ex: Para o amor da minha vida ❤️">
      </div>
      <button class="btn-enviar" onclick="enviarPedido()"><i class="fas fa-paper-plane"></i> ENVIAR PEDIDO</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SOBRE -->
<section id="sobre">
  <div class="section-title">Sobre a <span>Jovem FM</span></div>
  <p class="section-sub">Conectando corações através da música</p>
  <div style="max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center">
    <p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8;font-size:15px">
      A Rádio Jovem FM nasceu com uma missão: levar música de qualidade para cada lar, carro e coração. 
      Com uma grade variada que vai do sertanejo universitário ao pop romântico, estamos no ar 24 horas por dia 
      para fazer parte dos momentos mais especiais da sua vida. Sintonize, curta e peça sua música!
    </p>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:40px">
      <div style="background:var(--dark3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:24px">
        <div style="font-family:'Rajdhani',sans-serif;font-size:36px;font-weight:700;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold),var(--orange));-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent">24h</div>
        <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:4px">No ar todo dia</div>
      </div>
      <div style="background:var(--dark3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:24px">
        <div style="font-family:'Rajdhani',sans-serif;font-size:36px;font-weight:700;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--pink),var(--orange));-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent">+2800</div>
        <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:4px">Músicas no acervo</div>
      </div>
      <div style="background:var(--dark3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:24px">
        <div style="font-family:'Rajdhani',sans-serif;font-size:36px;font-weight:700;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--blue),var(--pink));-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent">+1K</div>
        <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:4px">Ouvintes por dia</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FOOTER -->
<footer>
